  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Fiscal Resilience for Sustainable Development Program, Subprogram 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will implement reforms to enhance fiscal and environmental sustainability as Palau emerges from the coronavirus disease (COVID-19) pandemic. It will improve fiscal discipline and strengthen the strategic allocation of resources, while comprehensively building climate change mitigation and adaptation into planning and budget execution. Subprogram 1 introduces new policies and practices to strengthen national and subnational public financial management (PFM) and support climate-resilient and sustainable growth.</narrative>
  </description>
