Implementation Period: Jan 30, 2022 - Dec 31, 2024</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action 1: 1.1.	To strengthen fiscal discipline and the strategic allocation of resources:
(i)	on 29 December 2023, the Minister, MOF endorsed implementation of a sequenced and time bound Public Financial Management Reform Roadmap and Action plan to address the weaknesses identified in the PEFA assessment, including enhancing climate resilience of government budget and assets, and set up a steering committee to oversee and manage the implementation of the Action Plan; and
(ii)	MOF commenced internal audits with a review and reconciliation of travel expenses in line with the PEFA Roadmap and Action Plan.
Target date: 
2024-12-31</narrative>
    </description>
